APPLY-BALANCE.
    *> Use positive available account balance only when balance use is allowed.
    IF BALANCE-ALLOWED = "Y" AND ACCOUNT-BALANCE > ZERO AND AMOUNT-DUE > ZERO
        IF ACCOUNT-BALANCE > AMOUNT-DUE
            MOVE AMOUNT-DUE TO APPLIED-OFFSET
        ELSE
            MOVE ACCOUNT-BALANCE TO APPLIED-OFFSET
        END-IF
        SUBTRACT APPLIED-OFFSET FROM AMOUNT-DUE
    END-IF
    EXIT.
