APPLY-REWARD.
    *> Use positive reward value only when the request qualifies for reward.
    IF REWARD-ELIGIBLE = "Y" AND REWARD-AMOUNT > ZERO AND AMOUNT-DUE > ZERO
        IF REWARD-AMOUNT > AMOUNT-DUE
            MOVE AMOUNT-DUE TO APPLIED-OFFSET
        ELSE
            MOVE REWARD-AMOUNT TO APPLIED-OFFSET
        END-IF
        SUBTRACT APPLIED-OFFSET FROM AMOUNT-DUE
    END-IF
    EXIT.
